@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 36
skinparam ranksep 34
skinparam ArrowColor #2563eb
skinparam ClassBorderColor #1e3a8a
skinparam ClassFontColor #0f172a
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #eff6ff
skinparam packageBorderColor #93c5fd
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #ffffff

package "Telemetry and Preparation" #eff6ff {
  class TrafficDataRepository {
    - trafficObservations
    - sensorMetadata
    - networkCoverage
  }

  class DataPreprocessor {
    - cleaningRules
    - qualityProfile
    + preprocessData()
    + standardizeInputs()
  }

  class SensorHealthAssessor {
    - reliabilityIndicators
    - anomalySignals
    + assessReliability()
    + flagDegradation()
  }
}

package "Forecasting" #fef3c7 {
  abstract class TrafficForecastModel {
    - modelConfiguration
    - forecastHorizon
    + train()
    + forecast()
    + evaluate()
  }

  class ForecastingCoordinator {
    - modelPortfolio
    - forecastResults
    + configureForecasting()
    + generateForecast()
  }
}

package "Causal Analysis" #f0fdfa {
  class CausalAnalysisService {
    - causalSpecification
    - analysisResults
    + analyzeDisparity()
    + performCausalAnalysis()
  }

  class RegionalErrorAnalyzer {
    - regionalDisparities
    - explanationProfile
    + compareRegions()
    + summarizeEffects()
  }
}

package "Digital Twin and Decision Support" #faf5ff {
  class DigitalTwinSimulator {
    - simulationState
    - maintenanceScenario
    + defineScenario()
    + simulateIntervention()
  }

  class DecisionSupportService {
    - evidenceSummary
    - visualizationArtifacts
    + displayResults()
    + generateReport()
  }
}

TrafficDataRepository --> DataPreprocessor : provides telemetry
DataPreprocessor --> SensorHealthAssessor : supplies cleaned data
SensorHealthAssessor --> ForecastingCoordinator : reliability inputs
SensorHealthAssessor --> CausalAnalysisService : health indicators
TrafficForecastModel <|-- ForecastingCoordinator
ForecastingCoordinator --> CausalAnalysisService : forecast outputs
CausalAnalysisService --> RegionalErrorAnalyzer : disparity findings
RegionalErrorAnalyzer --> DigitalTwinSimulator : scenario evidence
DigitalTwinSimulator --> DecisionSupportService : simulation outputs
ForecastingCoordinator --> DecisionSupportService : forecast summaries
CausalAnalysisService --> DecisionSupportService : causal findings

' Subtle ordering hints to keep the layout balanced in renderers
TrafficDataRepository -[hidden]right-> TrafficForecastModel
TrafficForecastModel -[hidden]right-> CausalAnalysisService
CausalAnalysisService -[hidden]right-> DigitalTwinSimulator
DigitalTwinSimulator -[hidden]right-> DecisionSupportService

@enduml
